sha256: c2ca46cb57ef4bf53c0d7795ad4f511547b61c2db4940bec87370a919799cbc3
Immediate source: src/idiff/data.py in identifiability-research-1.

That file is MODIFIED with respect to the upstream source. The research
generator replaces TCL's scale-modulated Laplace sources with a bounded
exponential family and statistics (z,z^2), and replaces the conditioned
uniform-matrix/leaky-ReLU mixing with orthogonal-matrix/leaky-tanh mixing after
artanh. These are research modifications, not the original TCL algorithm.

The other files in src/recovery_core/ have no TCL ancestor. They are additions
of the research project, or new to this repository.

The pinned TCL tree states its license in README but has no standalone LICENSE
or NOTICE file. The LICENSE and NOTICE files here are supplied by the research
project and are not verbatim upstream files.
